are complete; Core Pass 1 is not publication-ready.** WA's corrected body, OATH compilation,
the ordinary uninjected clean build, final SDK unit lane, docs-inclusive packaging,
freeze and fresh final evidence acceptance remain open. No missing result is represented as PASS.

